Q: Bulma Navbar buttons are misplaced and I want them unhidden A: <p>You have an extra <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> with a class of <code>&quot;navbar-start&quot;</code> that is not needed and you also need to get rid of <code>class=&quot;navbar-menu&quot;</code> as Bulma automatically hides the right side on small devices with this class.</p>
<pre><code>&lt;div id=&quot;navbarBasicExample&quot;&gt; 
             &lt;div class=&quot;navbar-end&quot;&gt;
              &lt;div class=&quot;navbar-item&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;buttons&quot;&gt;
